msgid "Built by Experts. Trusted by Thousands."
msgstr "Gebouwd door Experts. Vertrouwd door Duizenden."

msgid ""
"Led by experienced developers and powered by a passionate team, GSheetConnector "
"helps WordPress users automate their workflows with confidence."
msgstr ""
"Geleid door ervaren ontwikkelaars en aangedreven door een gepassioneerd team, "
"helpt GSheetConnector WordPress-gebruikers hun workflows met vertrouwen te "
"automatiseren."

msgid ""
"We focus on building tools that are fast, secure, and easy to use - so you can "
"spend less time managing data."
msgstr ""
"We richten ons op het bouwen van tools die snel, veilig en eenvoudig te gebruiken "
"zijn - zodat u minder tijd hoeft te besteden aan het beheren van gegevens."

msgid "Meet Our Core Team"
msgstr "Ontmoet Ons Kernteam"

msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Onze Missie"

msgid ""
"Our mission is to make form automation simple, secure, and reliable for every "
"WordPress user - from beginners to enterprise teams."
msgstr ""
"Onze missie is om formulierautomatisering eenvoudig, veilig en betrouwbaar te "
"maken voor elke WordPress-gebruiker - van beginners tot enterprise teams."

msgid "Fast & Reliable Data Sync"
msgstr "Snelle & Betrouwbare Gegevenssynchronisatie"

msgid "100% Secure Authentication"
msgstr "100% Veilige Authenticatie"

msgid "Real-Time Google Sheets Updates"
msgstr "Realtime Google Sheets Updates"

msgid "Easy Setup & Configuration"
msgstr "Eenvoudige Installatie & Configuratie"

msgid "Dedicated Support Team"
msgstr "Toegewijd Ondersteuningsteam"

msgid "Forms Successfully Synced"
msgstr "Formulieren Succesvol Gesynchroniseerd"

msgid "Trusted by Active Users"
msgstr "Vertrouwd door Actieve Gebruikers"

msgid "Reliable Uptime"
msgstr "Betrouwbare Uptime"

msgid "Dedicated Support"
msgstr "Toegewijde Ondersteuning"

msgid "Add-ons & Extensions"
msgstr "Add-ons & Extensies"

msgid ""
"Extend your Google Sheets integration with powerful add-ons. Install, manage, and "
"activate extensions to unlock advanced features."
msgstr ""
"Breid uw Google Sheets-integratie uit met krachtige add-ons. Installeer, beheer "
"en activeer extensies om geavanceerde functies te ontgrendelen."

msgid "CF7 Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "CF7 Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Easily connect Contact Form 7 to Google Sheets and automatically sync form "
"submissions in real-time. Every entry is instantly added to your selected "
"spreadsheet, helping you manage leads, inquiries, and customer data efficiently "
"without manual export."
msgstr ""
"Verbind eenvoudig Contactformulier 7 met Google Sheets en synchroniseer "
"automatisch formulierinzendingen in realtime. Elke invoer wordt onmiddellijk "
"toegevoegd aan uw geselecteerde spreadsheet, waardoor u leads, vragen en "
"klantgegevens efficiënt kunt beheren zonder handmatige export."

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installeren"

msgid "WPForms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "WPForms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Integrate WPForms with Google Sheets and send form entries directly to your "
"spreadsheet automatically. Track leads, manage customer data, and streamline "
"reporting with seamless Google Sheets integration and real-time sync."
msgstr ""
"Integreer WPForms met Google Sheets en stuur formulierinvoer automatisch "
"rechtstreeks naar uw spreadsheet. Volg leads, beheer klantgegevens en "
"vereenvoudig rapportage met naadloze Google Sheets-integratie en realtime "
"synchronisatie."

msgid "Gravity Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Gravity Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Connect Gravity Forms to Google Sheets and automatically push form submissions to "
"your spreadsheet. Simplify data management, improve workflow automation, and keep "
"all entries organized in one secure location."
msgstr ""
"Verbind Gravity Forms met Google Sheets en duw automatisch formulierinzendingen "
"naar uw spreadsheet. Vereenvoudig gegevensbeheer, verbeter workflowautomatisering "
"en houd alle invoer georganiseerd op één veilige locatie."

msgid "Ninja Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Ninja Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Automatically sync Ninja Forms submissions to Google Sheets with one-click "
"integration. Capture leads, monitor responses, and manage data efficiently with "
"instant spreadsheet updates and easy reporting."
msgstr ""
"Synchroniseer automatisch Ninja Forms inzendingen met Google Sheets met één klik "
"integratie. Leg leads vast, volg reacties en beheer gegevens efficiënt met "
"directe spreadsheetupdates en eenvoudige rapportage."

msgid "Forminator Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Forminator Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Integrate Forminator Forms with Google Sheets to automatically store form entries "
"in your spreadsheet. Eliminate manual data entry and ensure accurate, real-time "
"syncing for better data tracking and analysis."
msgstr ""
"Integreer Forminator Forms met Google Sheets om formulierinvoer automatisch in uw "
"spreadsheet op te slaan. Elimineer handmatige gegevensinvoer en zorg voor "
"nauwkeurige, realtime synchronisatie voor betere gegevensregistratie en analyse."

msgid "Free"
msgstr "Gratis"

msgid "Formidable Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Formidable Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Automatically sync Formidable Forms entries to Google Sheets. Manage leads, track "
"submissions, and simplify data reporting with real-time integration."
msgstr ""
"Synchroniseer automatisch Formidable Forms inzendingen met Google Sheets. Beheer "
"leads, volg inzendingen en vereenvoudig gegevensrapportage met realtime "
"integratie."

msgid "Fluent Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Fluent Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Automatically sync Fluent Forms submissions to Google Sheets in real-time. Every "
"form entry is instantly added to your selected spreadsheet, helping you manage "
"leads, customer inquiries, and business data without manual export. Streamline "
"your workflow, improve reporting accuracy, and keep all submissions organized "
"with seamless Google Sheets integration."
msgstr ""
"Synchroniseer automatisch Fluent Forms inzendingen in realtime met Google Sheets. "
"Elke formulierinvoer wordt onmiddellijk toegevoegd aan uw geselecteerde "
"spreadsheet, waardoor u leads, klantvragen en bedrijfsgegevens zonder handmatige "
"export kunt beheren. Vereenvoudig uw workflow, verbeter de nauwkeurigheid van "
"rapportage en houd alle inzendingen georganiseerd met naadloze Google Sheets-"
"integratie."

msgid "Elementor Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Elementor Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Sync Elementor Forms with Google Sheets instantly. Automatically add new form "
"submissions to your spreadsheet, manage leads efficiently, and simplify reporting "
"with real-time data synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Synchroniseer Elementor Forms onmiddellijk met Google Sheets. Voeg automatisch "
"nieuwe formulierinzendingen toe aan uw spreadsheet, beheer leads efficiënt en "
"vereenvoudig rapportage met realtime gegevenssynchronisatie."

msgid "Avada Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Avada Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Connect Avada Forms to Google Sheets and automatically transfer form entries to "
"your spreadsheet. Streamline lead management, automate data collection, and "
"improve business reporting with seamless integration."
msgstr ""
"Verbind Avada Forms met Google Sheets en draag automatisch formulierinvoer over "
"naar uw spreadsheet. Vereenvoudig leadbeheer, automatiseer gegevensverzameling en "
"verbeter bedrijfsrapportage met naadloze integratie."

msgid "Available PRO Version"
msgstr "Beschikbare PRO Versie"

msgid "Divi Forms Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Divi Forms Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Integrate Divi Forms with Google Sheets and automatically sync submissions in "
"real-time. Store customer data securely, track inquiries efficiently, and "
"eliminate manual spreadsheet updates."
msgstr ""
"Integreer Divi Forms met Google Sheets en synchroniseer inzendingen automatisch "
"in realtime. Bewaar klantgegevens veilig, volg vragen efficiënt en elimineer "
"handmatige spreadsheetupdates."

msgid "WP Core Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "WP Core Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Automatically send WordPress core data (like comments or custom submissions) to "
"Google Sheets. Simplify website data tracking, automate record keeping, and "
"centralize important information in one organized spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Stuur automatisch WordPress kerngegevens (zoals opmerkingen of aangepaste "
"inzendingen) naar Google Sheets. Vereenvoudig het volgen van websitegegevens, "
"automatiseer het bijhouden van records en centraliseer belangrijke informatie in "
"één georganiseerde spreadsheet."

msgid "WooCommerce Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "WooCommerce Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Sync WooCommerce orders with Google Sheets automatically. Store order details, "
"customer information, and transaction data in real-time for easy reporting, "
"accounting, and business analysis."
msgstr ""
"Synchroniseer WooCommerce-bestellingen automatisch met Google Sheets. Bewaar "
"bestelgegevens, klantinformatie en transactiegegevens in realtime voor eenvoudige "
"rapportage, boekhouding en bedrijfsanalyse."

msgid "Easy Digital Downloads Google Sheet Connector"
msgstr "Easy Digital Downloads Google Sheet Connector"

msgid ""
"Automatically send Easy Digital Downloads (EDD) order details to Google Sheets. "
"Track digital product sales, monitor transactions, and manage customer data "
"effortlessly with real-time spreadsheet integration."
msgstr ""
"Stuur automatisch Easy Digital Downloads (EDD) bestelgegevens naar Google Sheets. "
"Volg digitale productverkopen, monitor transacties en beheer klantgegevens "
"moeiteloos met realtime spreadsheetintegratie."

